  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7fe0f0358ea5fe82c3321dce43589ab64119f6e6.png\" alt=\"Pipe Guns：Gamingbarn&#x27;s 槍械擴充包\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fgun-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3d5cca0e504d6d4c12c05642e2f5e6ab43dbf04a.jpeg\" alt=\"Gun Core 相依性裝飾圖\"></a>\nPipe Guns 需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fgun-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gun Core</a>！*</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>//cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/58f5ef67af3ef94c0e3abef909cbc6953ac1a124.png\"_alt=\"pipe_assault_rifle_and_pipe_bolt-action_rifle\">\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/58f5ef67af3ef94c0e3abef909cbc6953ac1a124.png\" alt=\"管製突擊步槍與管製栓動步槍\"></th>\n<th>Pipe Guns 新增了 6 種受《異塵餘生》系列管製槍枝啟發的全新武器！這些槍枝均需混合銅材與木材製作，使其比大多數槍枝更為便宜且易於取得。儘管外觀樸素粗糙，它們依然威力不容小覷！</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>本模組中的所有槍枝配方皆可於原版工作台食譜簿中查看。若要搜尋槍枝，可在搜尋欄輸入「shoot」！你也可以透過執行給予指令來獲得本模組新增的槍枝：<code>/function give:[gun_name]</code></strong></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e01bf14d9d7df48878569df9b7f1d5c99fcea1f2.png\" alt=\"顯示管製槍枝列表的工作台食譜簿\">~~~~</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><em>你可以使用我網站上的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgamingbarn.net%252fGunGenerator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gun Generator</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgamingbarn.net%252fAmmoGenerator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ammo Generator</a> 製作屬於自己的類似模組包！</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2775\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3218c2c5a3d76150c48315a647b9803a1a1abb00.jpeg\" alt=\"SparkedHost 促銷圖片\"></a> 想要架設 Minecraft 伺服器嗎？考慮看看 SparkedHost！使用折扣碼 GAMINGBARN 可享 8 折優惠！</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d6dc9d56feee16e94cb60cccde0087803114ac61.jpeg\" alt=\"Discord 促銷圖片\"><br>\n  **_<a href=\"https://discord.gg/dKMxTjchsg_**\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/dKMxTjchsg_**</a><br>\n  需要我的模組協助嗎？發現了錯誤嗎？想分享回饋嗎？歡迎加入我的 Discord 伺服器！在那裡我可以針對你遇到的任何問題提供個人化的協助！</p>\n</blockquote>",
